WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.209
Use correct simple, continuous and perfect verb forms; agree with the subject and

00:00:05.209 --> 00:00:06.365
keep tense consistent.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:10.827
Which is a verb in “Kofi carried a basket”? Answer: carried

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:16.958
Revise a paragraph containing present, past and perfect tense errors; explain your

00:00:16.958 --> 00:00:17.396
changes.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:20.269
Why it works: Carried shows an action.
